   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Alex, thanks for pointing this out. Just to clarify the severity of the bug, there&#39;s no side effect other than an error message being printed at the console, right? i.e. it doesn&#39;t affect the correct operation of the rest of the application?<div class=\"gmail_extra\">\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
