:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">session</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">get</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">paste</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\"> name</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">&#39;_width&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\"> sep</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">));</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\">etc.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br>\r\n</span></div><div>at invocation of the lambda returned by reactivePlot, but before it invokes the actual myPlot function.</div><div> <br></div><div>I suspect the problem is that shiny is not checking to see if this call to session$get fails (which it must).</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>Expected behaviour:</div><div><br></div><div>no error message</div><div><br></div><div>Suggested implementation:</div><div><pre><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;padding-left:10px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">if</span> <span>(is.null(width) || is.null(height) || </span>width <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">0</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">||</span> height <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">0</span><span>)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;padding-left:10px\">      <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">return</span><span>(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">NULL</span><span>)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;padding-left:10px\"><span><br></span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Alternative implementation:</font></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Ask session$get to see if the plot itself exists and bail if it doesn&#39;t.</font></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Note that this issue also means that a single plot cannot be re-used by multiple output points, which has been noted elsewhere.  I don&#39;t know if this is important.</font></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Thanks!</font></span></div>\r\n<span><font color=\"#888888\"><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">-Alex Brown</font></span></div>\r\n</font></span></pre></div></blockquote></div></div>"
